m004_type_definitions.pseudo:2:22: Semantic error M004: A SET can only hold simple values such as CHAR, INTEGER or an enumerated type, not a Node record
   TYPE BadSet = SET OF Node
                        ^
m004_type_definitions.pseudo:3:1: Semantic error M004: The record Node contains itself, so it would be infinitely large. Use a pointer type for the link instead
   TYPE Node
   ^
m004_type_definitions.pseudo:8:13: Semantic error M001: Unknown type Missing. Define it with TYPE or CLASS, or use INTEGER, REAL, CHAR, STRING, BOOLEAN or DATE
   TYPE Ptr = ^Missing
               ^
m004_type_definitions.pseudo:11:18: Semantic error M004: B cannot inherit from A, because A already inherits from B (directly or indirectly)
   CLASS B INHERITS A
                    ^
m004_type_definitions.pseudo:13:18: Semantic error M004: Season is not a class, so C cannot inherit from it
   CLASS C INHERITS Season
                    ^
m004_type_definitions.pseudo:15:18: Semantic error M001: Unknown class Nowhere, so D cannot inherit from it
   CLASS D INHERITS Nowhere
                    ^
m004_type_definitions.pseudo:17:21: Semantic error M004: A class cannot inherit from itself
   CLASS Self INHERITS Self
                       ^
